Source: stannum
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), clang, libclang-dev, git, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/TeamSpringbird/stannum

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-stannum
Architecture: any
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Experimental TINQL text search and BM25 ranking for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 Stannum provides persistent segmented indexes, TINQL queries and BM25 ranking.
 This package contains an unreleased development snapshot. Do not install
 stannum and tin in the same database because their global operators conflict.
 Preloading is optional on a primary; standby index reads require preloading
 on both the primary and standby.
